                f"- Reference set structure: `{mature_nonlocal_count}/5 mature non-local`, `{local_tight_count}/5 local tight`, `{same_pocket_count}/5 same pocket`, `{same_overlay_count}/5 same overlay`",
                f"- Median reference state: `close_prob={_format_float_compact_v1(median_ref_prob, 3)}`, `minutes={_format_float_compact_v1(median_ref_minutes, 0)}`, `MFE={_format_float_compact_v1(median_ref_mfe, 2)}`, `dd_from_peak={_format_float_compact_v1(median_ref_dd, 2)}`",
                f"- Local-twin status: `{local_twin_status}`. {local_twin_text}",
                f"- Why refs EXITed while target HOLDed: `{exit_explanation_status}`. {exit_explanation_text}",
                f"- Local reference note: {local_reference_note}",
